  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1508.01 Demand Issued from Attorney General's Office. A written demand issued by the attorney general or an authorized assistant attorney general, pursuant to RSA 7:6-b, shall be issued on the letterhead of the attorney general's office.\n\nSource. #8082, eff 5-8-04",
